      "description": "<b>Wounded:</b> The Hydromorph staggers, bleeding profusely. It suffers Speed -1 (down to a minimum of 1, losing the lowest initiative), but regains one point of Health. Roll a d6 at the start of each round. On a 1-3, it shakes, showering acid on all targets in close range if not in water. If in water, it will call for aid, summoning one new Hydromorph, which will arrive at the end of the next round.",
