      "description": "<b>Tactical Thinking:</b> The Hydromorph is badly wounded. It immediately performs both a fast and a slow action, outside of the normal turn order. If outnumbered, it tries to escape; if it has the advantage, it will attack again. In any case it regains 1 point of health.",
