      "description": "<b>Last Embrace:</b> The Hydromorph is mortally wounded and contorts wildly. On its next initiative, it will attempt to kill the nearest victim by wrapping itself around the target like a snake and squeezing, causing [[6db]] damage plus an acid splash as the creature tears itself apart (no extra dice – short range targets also affected). After this, the beast dies. If it is wounded again before this occurs, it dies instantly.",
